<title>NIGERIA: NIGERIA FIRST BANK HALF-YR PROFITS JUMP.</title>
<headline>NIGERIA FIRST BANK HALF-YR PROFITS JUMP.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year results for First Bank Nigeria to end-June 1997 published on Thursday.</p>
<p>			   (In million naira)</p>
<p>				  1997	1996</p>
<p>Gross earnings	     5,393     5,302</p>
<p>Profit before taxation     807	 641</p>
<p>($1=83 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
